<description>Power</description>
<plain>
<text x="10.16" y="134.62" size="3.81" layer="94">BOOST</text>
<text x="60.96" y="142.24" size="1.778" layer="91">VBOOST = 1.25( R121 / R124 + 1) = 9V56</text>
<text x="10.16" y="66.04" size="3.81" layer="94">+4V5 Leds</text>
<text x="322.58" y="238.76" size="1.778" layer="91">1UH, low DCR recommended
This is 3.3UH</text>
<text x="279.4" y="149.86" size="1.778" layer="91">INT is a DIN to the Daisy</text>
<text x="307.34" y="180.34" size="1.778" layer="91">float RST if unused</text>
<text x="325.628" y="207.264" size="1.778" layer="91">Connect SNS close to terminal</text>
